{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得亲近时的安心、不计较地关心对方的满足和独自珍藏喜欢的甜意，虽没许诺却都是真的。\",\n      \"key\": \"独自珍藏\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S08-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得亲近时的安心和独自珍藏的快乐都是真的，便不再因怕受伤压住欢喜，连玩心也冒出来。\",\n      \"key\": \"怕受伤\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S08-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他放开欢喜后，给得多了也不再一笔笔算，一时顾不上那份沉重，也不急着替未来留退路。\",\n      \"key\": \"不再一笔笔算\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S08-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他又盼对方也珍惜自己，却知道眼前的亲近证明不了对方的心意，便重新在意起来。\",\n      \"key\": \"证明不了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S08-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他曾把喜欢独自珍藏，想到这一刻终究留不住，便也想把这份欢喜留在心里。\",\n      \"key\": \"终究留不住\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S08-6\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "62f679f1-3d21-413b-87a7-ff29fd7a5e09", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T191219034667Z", "elapsed_seconds": 281.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T19:17:00.196557+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f7f70db11de61ee665f1c12b3e6e1a8125cbbb1956c8ae59184bf84486ad2036", "attachment_c